  t += mode === 'tol' ? 'Tolerance = SurQC BasicQc on the measured data: |Dip − ref| &gt; tol, else |BT − ref| &gt; tol.'
     : mode === 'trend' ? 'Trend = SurQC AutoQc: weighted quadratic trend vs MD of ΔBT, ΔDip, GT and short-collar Bz-bias; a station is flagged when it is off its trend by more than the tolerance (Bz-bias tolerance default 300 nT pending John\'s value).'
